// destructibledef's piece (0x3c8 bytes, the array at the def's 0x20, its count at 0x18): seven
// stages of 0x78 as HydraX's DestructiblePieceOffsets (transcribed from HydraX's tables,
// HydraX never finished the type), then the piece's own fields, whose keys go to the destructibledef
// entry ('#': the piece's index).
// hand edit: the six flag bits of each stage (HydraX: no handler case) read as one number,
// flags<stage>, split by the converter (type.jsonc "flags"); breakHealth a fraction of 100 (scale);
// fx paths under share/raw/fx (prefix ""); the piece's fields (0x348...) from mp_sector's
// veh_t7_civ_citycar_destructible against the Mod Tools' veh_t7_civ_city_car.gdt.
